{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781940/extras/2f7cc6d7e86ecca4406ed428ab8917b7.avif?t=1768528062\" width=1000 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A delivery simulator full of charm, heart, and a whole lot of cargo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781940/extras/158527bd762c21fa859bbdfb008af1dd.poster.avif?t=1768528062\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781940/extras/158527bd762c21fa859bbdfb008af1dd.webm?t=1768528062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781940/extras/158527bd762c21fa859bbdfb008af1dd.mp4?t=1768528062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Step into the shoes of <strong>Leo</strong>, a new recruit at Bay Express, as you navigate a vibrant city filled with unique neighborhoods, unforgettable characters, and stories tucked between packages and delivery notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this stylized low-poly game with a cozy atmosphere, you\u2019ll face the daily grind of a delivery worker on the rise. Each day brings new routes, quirky clients, and choices that shape your journey toward becoming a partner at Bay Express\u2014if you can survive the daily hustle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore districts like <strong>Crystal Bay</strong>, with its lakeside mansions, or brave the industrial maze of <strong>Rustpoint</strong>. Uncover local dramas, urban mysteries, and unexpected friendships with residents like Seu Arlindo, the wise grocer full of sayings, and Elias Ramos, a former fisherman turned contemplative pier clerk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Courier Bay is more than just delivering packages \u2014 it\u2019s about <strong>meeting people, understanding places, and growing through the ordinary.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781940/extras/c4bdc35e10ecb41513ef8a6b38b48a7c.poster.avif?t=1768528062\" width=854 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781940/extras/c4bdc35e10ecb41513ef8a6b38b48a7c.webm?t=1768528062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781940/extras/c4bdc35e10ecb41513ef8a6b38b48a7c.mp4?t=1768528062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Narrative delivery simulation</strong> with evolving daily missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude9a <strong>Multiple vehicles</strong>, including trucks, vans, and jeeps, each with unique physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f <strong>A rich and varied city</strong> with over 100 buildings, including rural, industrial, and urban areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>NPCs with unique personalities</strong> and custom-crafted dialogue interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Top-down interactive map</strong> with free navigation between districts and landmarks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s your first day on the job. The city is waiting. <br>Courier Bay \u2014 <strong>where every package has a story.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storep